robopi-config (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial RoboParty release
  * Fork from raspi-config, adapted for RoboParty boards
  * Added hardware test functions for WiFi, Ethernet, USB, CAN, ADB,
    Serial, RS485, GPIO, HDMI
  * Removed Raspberry Pi specific hardware detection
  * Renamed to robopi-config

